{"ID":"20240515143628-r4nsn4s","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515143628-r4nsn4s","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143628-r4nsn4s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143917-rbqp7zn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143917-rbqp7zn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143917-rbqp7zn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:474,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:474\u0026#125;","title":"113","type":"doc","updated":"20240515185154"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143917-rbqp7zn","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 700px;","id":"20240515143917-rbqp7zn","updated":"20240515185154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ZZ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46歲，中等身材，偏瘦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/15"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診以憂鬱症為主訴來診，師診斷為真寒假熱，予四逆湯加減。三日後復來二診，自言足較溫，仍有頭痛、噯氣。惡寒，時頭暈，口渴喜溫飲，背痛兼帶脈痛。胃口不太好。月經快來了。臉上乾癬不癢但會脫皮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）出汗：能流汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）寒熱：已無偶然發熱，感覺發冷。手冷額熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）呼吸：仍短氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）痛：帶脈痛及頭痛仍有，且時暈眩"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）胃口：不好，仍有噯氣"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）大便：每日一行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）小便：小便黃，量無增加"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈虛數，重按無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紅乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裏寒仍有"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足臨泣、雙委中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢、白芍五錢、炙甘草三錢、當歸二錢、木通二錢、細辛二錢、大棗十個、"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢、生薑二片、鬱金五錢、黃芩三錢、遠志五錢、龍骨三錢、茯神三錢、"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茯苓五錢、吳茱萸二錢、乾薑二錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每付用九碗煮三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由脈虛數無力且手冷額熱可知屬裏寒。初診用四逆湯，這次改用當歸四逆湯。但裏寒去掉時，如冰雪溶，小便量會增加。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腰部酸痛環腰而行是帶脈痛，藥用苓桂甘棗湯，針下足臨泣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}